<section class="sa-block" style="padding:48px 0 44px;background:#fff">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>A packing service for a house move means someone else packs the whole home, carefully and in an order that makes sense, so you do not have to lift, bend or decide in a hurry. It suits anyone short of time or strength, and is designed with older people in mind. Chayce includes packing of every room, with fragile items protected and boxes labelled by destination room, from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}, and can unpack at the other end from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("silver")).price | gbp }}.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
