<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="rx-lead">
      <div class="rx-photo">{% image "hiw2-quote-moving-boxes.jpg", "A woman packing a box carefully for a move" %}<div class="rx-tag">from<strong>&pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("bronze")).price | gbp }}</strong>packing and removals</div></div>
      <div class="rx-copy">
        <span class="gd-eyebrow" style="text-align:left">Packing service</span>
        <h2>Packed <em>carefully</em>, labelled clearly</h2>
        <p class="rx-sub">Packing a home is tiring and, for many people, physically too much, especially after many years in one place. Our packing service takes the heavy, repetitive work off your shoulders while you stay in charge of what goes where.</p>
        <ul class="rx-points"><li><i class="fas fa-box-open" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Every room packed</h3><p>Professional packing of all rooms, so there are no half-finished cupboards or boxes left for the family to deal with.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-shield-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Fragile items protected</h3><p>China, glass, ornaments and sentimental pieces are packed with protective materials as standard, with no extra charge for careful handling.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-tags" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Labelled by room</h3><p>Boxes are labelled by destination room, so unpacking at the new home is quicker and calmer.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-pills" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Essentials kept to hand</h3><p>Medication, important papers and the things you need on the first night are kept accessible rather than buried in boxes.</p></li></ul>
        <p class="rx-where">Packing is included from Bronze Essentials. Unpacking and setting up the new home is included from Silver Comfort. Packing is carried out by DBS-checked staff.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec grey">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">How packing works</span><h2>From first look to <em>last box</em></h2></div>
    <ol class="rx-line" style="--n:4"><li><span class="gd-num">1</span><h3>Plan it</h3><p>A Discovery Consultation, from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }}, sets out a plan, timeline and budget in an hour, before you commit to anything.</p></li><li><span class="gd-num">2</span><h3>Decide what comes</h3><p>You decide what is moving, what is staying and what is going to family or charity. Sorting help is available from Silver Comfort.</p></li><li><span class="gd-num">3</span><h3>We pack</h3><p>Room by room, with fragile and sentimental items protected and boxes labelled by destination.</p></li><li><span class="gd-num">4</span><h3>We move and set up</h3><p>An insured removal, then unpacking and set-up at the new home with Silver Comfort or above.</p></li></ol>
    <p class="rx-cap">Most people book packing a few weeks before the move. Tell us your dates and we will say what is possible.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gd-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="gd-head"><span class="gd-eyebrow">Packing yourself or having it done</span><h2>When a packing service <em>helps most</em></h2></div>
    <div class="gd-rows">
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>Limited strength or mobility</h3><p>Lifting, bending and standing for long periods are hard on the body. A packing team does the physical work for you.</p></div>
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>A short timescale</h3><p>When a sale, a care place or a retirement flat has a fixed date, a team can pack in days what might take weeks alone.</p></div>
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>Family far away</h3><p>If children or relatives live a long way off, a coordinator and packing team take the strain, with the family kept informed.</p></div>
      <div class="gd-row"><h3>Fragile or treasured things</h3><p>Antiques, china and keepsakes are packed with proper protection and handled with care.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

