<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Packing Service for House Moves: Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Do you offer a packing service for house moves?</summary><p>Yes. Packing of all rooms is included from Bronze Essentials at &pound;995, with fragile items protected and boxes labelled by destination room. Packing is carried out by DBS-checked staff, and the service is open to anyone, not only older people.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer a packing service for elderly people?</summary><p>Yes. Packing of all rooms is included from Bronze Essentials at &pound;995, with fragile items protected and boxes labelled by destination room. Packing is carried out by DBS-checked staff.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does a packing service cost?</summary><p>Packing and an insured removal start at &pound;995 with Bronze Essentials. Silver Comfort at &pound;1,850 adds declutter help, a deep clean and unpacking. A Discovery Consultation costs &pound;150. The final cost depends on the size of the home and the help you need.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you pack fragile items like china and ornaments?</summary><p>Yes. Fragile and sentimental items are packed with protective materials as standard, with no extra charge for careful handling.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will you unpack at the new home?</summary><p>Yes, from Silver Comfort. Unpacking and setting up the new home is included in that package and above. Bronze Essentials covers packing and the removal.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I keep some things out of the packing?</summary><p>Of course. You decide what is packed. Medication, important papers and things you need straight away are kept accessible rather than packed away.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How far ahead should I book?</summary><p>Most people book a few weeks before the move. Tell us your dates and we will say what is possible. For a large home or a tight timescale, the earlier the better.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is the removal insured?</summary><p>Yes. Every Chayce removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit, and the cover is set out in your service agreement before the move begins.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you work outside Northampton?</summary><p>Yes. We are based in Northampton and arrange moves across the whole UK.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

